  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Evidence in Education (BE2) Funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to improved education outcomes from the research and evidence generated and disseminated by BE2 and its members. The Secretariat aims to support the continuous coordination of donor agencies and to enhance standards in evidence creation and usage in the education sector 
The Secretariat will also support the objectives of the Global Education Evidence Advisory Panel (GEEAP).</narrative>
  </description>
